<p>Your passion for singing the praises of the Sun reaches its zenith.</p><p>Your Chanting now increases your light and fire damage by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">16%, 22%, 27%, 30%, 34%</acronym> and, up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> times per turn when you are hit by a weapon attack, you will gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2.0, 3.0, 3.8, 4.4, 5.0</acronym> Positive Energy.</p><p>These values scale with your Spellpower.</p>